" Vim compiler file
" Compiler:     splint/lclint (C source code checker)
" Maintainer:   Ralf Wildenhues <Ralf.Wildenhues@gmx.de>
" Splint Home:	http://www.splint.org/
" Last Change:  2019 Jul 23
