        keys:
        ‚Ä¢ "height" Requested height of the UI
        ‚Ä¢ "width" Requested width of the UI
        ‚Ä¢ "rgb" true if the UI uses RGB colors (false implies |cterm-colors|)
        ‚Ä¢ "ext_..." Requested UI extensions, see |ui-option|
        ‚Ä¢ "chan" |channel-id| of remote UI

