|zt|		zt		   redraw, cursor line at top of window
|zuw|		zuw		   undo |zw|
|zug|		zug		   undo |zg|
|zuW|		zuW		   undo |zW|
|zuG|		zuG		   undo |zG|
|zv|		zv		   open enough folds to view the cursor line
|zw|		zw		   permanently mark word as incorrectly spelled
|zx|		zx		   re-apply 'foldlevel' and do "zv"
