      ‚Ä¢ {bufnr}      (`integer`) Buffer to highlight, or `0` for current
                     buffer.
      ‚Ä¢ {client_id}  (`integer`) ID of the |vim.lsp.Client|
      ‚Ä¢ {hl_group}   (`string`) Highlight group name
      ‚Ä¢ {opts}       (`table?`) Optional parameters:
                     ‚Ä¢ {priority}? (`integer`, default:
                       `vim.hl.priorities.semantic_tokens + 3`) Priority for
                       the applied extmark.

