" vim: nowrap sw=2 sts=2 ts=8 noet:
" Vim filetype plugin file
" Language:             passwd(5) password file
" Previous Maintainer:  Nikolai Weibull <now@bitwi.se>
" Latest Revision:      2008-07-09

