" Language:	LifeLines
" Maintainer:	Patrick Texier <p.texier@orsennes.com>
" Location:	<http://patrick.texier.free.fr/vim/indent/lifelines.vim>
" Last Change:	2010 May 7

" Only load this indent file when no other was loaded.
