[U √õ LATIN CAPITAL LETTER U WITH CIRCUMFLEX
[I √é LATIN CAPITAL LETTER I WITH CIRCUMFLEX
[O √î LATIN CAPITAL LETTER O WITH CIRCUMFLEX
{{ ¬® UMLAUT
{q √§ LATIN SMALL LETTER A WITH UMLAUT
