{y √ø LATIN SMALL LETTER Y WITH UMLAUT
{u √º LATIN SMALL LETTER U WITH UMLAUT
{i √Ø LATIN SMALL LETTER I WITH UMLAUT
{o √∂ LATIN SMALL LETTER O WITH UMLAUT
{Q √Ñ LATIN CAPITAL LETTER A WITH UMLAUT
{E √ã LATIN CAPITAL LETTER E WITH UMLAUT
