+A √Ä LATIN CAPITAL LETTER A WITH GRAVE
y z LATIN SMALL LETTER Z
[ √º LATIN SMALL LETTER U WITH UMLAUT
] + ASCII PLUS
\\ # ASCII NUMBER SIGN
; √∂ LATIN SMALL LETTER O WITH UMLAUT
' √§ LATIN SMALL LETTER A WITH UMLAUT
z y LATIN SMALL LETTER Y
/ - ASCII MINUS
~ ¬∞ DEGREE SIGN
@ " ASCII DOUBLE QUOTES
# ¬ß SECTION SIGN
^ & ASCII AMPERSAND
& / ASCII SLASH
* ( ASCII LEFT PARENTHESIS
( ) ASCII RIGHT PARENTHESIS
