| ' ASCII SINGLE QUOTE
: √ñ LATIN CAPITAL LETTER O WITH UMLAUT
\" √Ñ LATIN CAPITAL LETTER A WITH UMLAUT
Z Y LATIN CAPITAL LETTER Y
< ; ASCII SEMICOLON 
> : ASCII COLON 
? _ ASCII UNDERSCORE
