syn keyword chuckAdvancedUGen CurveTable WarpTable Dyno

" https://chuck.cs.princeton.edu/doc/reference/
syn keyword chuckChugin ABSaturator AmbPan3 Bitcrusher Elliptic ExpDelay ExpEnv FIR
