" Vim syntax file
" Language:     Elsa
" Maintainer:   Miles Glapa-Grossklag <miles@glapa-grossklag.com>
" Last Change:  2023-01-29
"               2024 May 25 by Riley Bruins <ribru17@gmail.com> (move 'commentstring' to ftplugin)

