  syn keyword rapidMovement ArcRepL ArcAdaptLStart ArcAdaptL ArcAdaptC ArcAdaptLEnd ArcAdaptCEnd ArcCalcLStart ArcCalcL ArcCalcC ArcCalcLEnd ArcCalcCEnd ArcAdaptRepL
