" Vim syntax file
" Language:             screen(1) configuration file
" Maintainer:           Aliaksei Budavei <0x000c70 AT gmail DOT com>
" Previous Maintainers: Dmitri Vereshchagin <dmitri.vereshchagin@gmail.com>
