syn keyword vimVimVarName contained  argf argv cascading char charconvert_from charconvert_to cmdarg cmdbang collate completed_item count count1 ctype dying echospace errmsg errors event exception exiting exitreason false fcs_choice fcs_reason fname fname_diff fname_in fname_new fname_out folddashes foldend foldlevel foldstart hlsearch insertmode key lang lc_time lnum lua maxcol mouse_col mouse_lnum mouse_win mouse_winid msgpack_types null numbermax numbermin numbersize oldfiles operator option_command option_new option_old option_oldglobal option_oldlocal option_type prevcount profiling progname progpath register relnum scrollstart searchforward servername shell_error stacktrace startreason starttime statusmsg stderr swapchoice swapcommand swapname t_blob t_bool t_dict t_float t_func t_list t_number t_string termrequest termresponse testing
