Xf86confdeclopt NoTexturedVideo NoTrapSignals NoUseFBDev NoUseModeline NoUseVclk1 NoVTSysReq
Xf86confdeclopt NoXVideo NvAGP OSMImageBuffers OffTime Origin OverClockMem Overlay
